  "ingredients": [
    "2 1/3 cup almond flour",
    "2/3 cup allulose",
    "1/4 cup unflavored low-carb protein powder",
    "2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "2 teaspoon pumpkin pie spice",
    "1/4 teaspoon salt",
    "3 large egg",
    "2/3 cup pumpkin puree",
    "3/4 cup unsalted butter (melted + divided)",
    "1/2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "8 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "3/4 cup allulose (powdered)",
    "1/2 cup pecans (chopped)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all of the ingredients. Preheat oven to 325F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-earthquake-cake/#wprm-recipe-54629-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Pumpkin-Earthquake-Cake-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grease a baking pan with butter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-earthquake-cake/#wprm-recipe-54629-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Pumpkin-Earthquake-Cake-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, combine almond flour, allulose, protein powder, baking powder, pumpkin pie spice, and salt. Whisk to combine well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-earthquake-cake/#wprm-recipe-54629-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Pumpkin-Earthquake-Cake-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the pumpkin puree, half of the melted butter, vanilla extract, and egg.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-earthquake-cake/#wprm-recipe-54629-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Pumpkin-Earthquake-Cake-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir to combine well and evenly.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-earthquake-cake/#wprm-recipe-54629-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Pumpkin-Earthquake-Cake-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the mixture evenly into the greased baking dish. Spread it out with a spatula to get it smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-earthquake-cake/#wprm-recipe-54629-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Pumpkin-Earthquake-Cake-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a mixing bowl, combine the softened cream cheese with the rest of the melted butter and the powdered allulose.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-earthquake-cake/#wprm-recipe-54629-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Pumpkin-Earthquake-Cake-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat with a mixer until well combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-earthquake-cake/#wprm-recipe-54629-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Pumpkin-Earthquake-Cake-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread this over the smoothed out mixture that's already in the baking dish.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-earthquake-cake/#wprm-recipe-54629-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Pumpkin-Earthquake-Cake-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the oven for 45 minutes or until the center is slightly jiggly whilst the outer edge is thoroughly cooked.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-earthquake-cake/#wprm-recipe-54629-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Pumpkin-Earthquake-Cake-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let the cake cool completely and then add the chopped pecans to the top of the cake.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-earthquake-cake/#wprm-recipe-54629-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Pumpkin-Earthquake-Cake-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice, serve, and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-earthquake-cake/#wprm-recipe-54629-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
